<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login | OrganizaPay</title>
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#020617">
  <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="OrganizaPay">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'class', theme: { extend: { fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] } } } };
    if (localStorage.getItem('theme') === 'dark' || (!('theme' in localStorage) && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
      document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
    } else {
      document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
    }
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css" />
</head>
<body class="op-auth-page flex items-center justify-center p-4 font-sans sm:p-6">
  <div class="op-auth-shell">
    <div class="op-auth-card grid overflow-hidden lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.05fr)_420px]">
      <section class="relative z-10 border-b border-slate-200/70 px-6 py-7 dark:border-slate-800 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:px-8 lg:py-9">
        <span class="op-auth-badge">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 11c0 .552-.224 1.052-.586 1.414A1.992 1.992 0 019.999 13a1.99 1.99 0 01-1.414-.586A1.992 1.992 0 018 11V9a4 4 0 118 0v2zm0 0v4m0 0h3m-3 0H9"></path></svg>
          Google Sign-In
        </span>
        <h1 class="op-auth-title mt-5 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50">Acesso rápido com sua conta Google.</h1>
        <p class="op-auth-text mt-4">A autenticação por Google simplifica o acesso e reduz atrito no celular, mantendo o aplicativo restrito a usuários autorizados.</p>

        <div class="op-auth-feature-grid mt-7">
          <div class="op-auth-feature">
            <div class="op-auth-feature__icon">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__title">Continuar de qualquer aparelho</div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__text">Ideal para usar no computador, no celular e no modo PWA com a mesma conta autorizada.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="op-auth-feature">
            <div class="op-auth-feature__icon">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__title">Conta certa, acesso certo</div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__text">Só usuários autorizados conseguem entrar e usar as áreas protegidas do OrganizaPay.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="op-auth-feature">
            <div class="op-auth-feature__icon">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__title">Experiência rápida no celular</div>
              <div class="op-auth-feature__text">Fluxo curto, botões grandes e continuidade perfeita com a versão instalada na tela inicial.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="relative z-10 px-6 py-7 lg:px-8 lg:py-9">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="OrganizaPay" class="mx-auto mb-6 w-full max-w-[260px] drop-shadow-[0_18px_26px_rgba(37,99,235,0.16)] sm:max-w-[300px]">

        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
          <div class="mb-5 rounded-[22px] border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-red-700 dark:border-red-800 dark:bg-red-900/25 dark:text-red-200">
            <%= error %>
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">Login</div>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50">Entre com sua conta Google</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Um toque para iniciar a sessão e continuar de onde parou.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="/auth/google" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-100 dark:hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-slate-900">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/>
            <path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/>
            <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/>
            <path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/>
            <path fill="none" d="M0 0h48v48H0z"/>
          </svg>
          Entrar com Google
        </a>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Acesso restrito a usuários autorizados.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Ao continuar, você concorda com o processamento dos dados necessários para autenticação e uso do aplicativo.
          <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:text-blue-200">Política de Privacidade</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
